%% IMAGO-4 — Three ladders interleaved (DEPLOY-1). Status: Proposed
flowchart TD
  H0["MT2 row zero: install pack + inventory<br/>(BLOCKED — no evidence yet)"] --> HP["Hardening pass W0→W11<br/>100% ledger or escalated"]
  G0["GATE-000: counsel opinion +<br/>intended-purpose + positioning + patient-surface<br/>(BLOCKS regulated tooling)"] --> G1["GATE-001: Ketryx/Jira + ISO 14971 risk file<br/>+ substrate decision (DEC-03)"]
